  <div class="bio-copy prose">
    <p class="lead">I'm Thibauld Croonenborghs, a Data Architect at AE. I work across data platforms, architecture, and engineering.</p>
    <p>I started at the Belgian Royal Military Academy. I then spent several years as an army officer while studying computer science before moving into software and data.</p>
    <p>These days, I work with Microsoft Fabric, Azure, Hadoop, and Databricks. I especially enjoy Python and Spark, and I speak about the practical side of data engineering: performance, architecture, testing, and choosing the right tool for the job.</p>
